### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### NAV (call twice: second response has fromCache = true)
GET http://localhost:8080/funds/FF-EQUITY/nav

### Subscribe 1,000 THB (send twice with the same key -> same order back, no duplicate)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-sub-001

{ "fundCode": "FF-EQUITY", "type": "Subscription", "amount": 1000 }

### Redeem 100.5 units
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-red-001

{ "fundCode": "FF-BOND", "type": "Redemption", "units": 100.5 }

### Check status (paste the id from the response above)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/{{orderId}}
